msgid "Modules"
msgstr "模块"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/index.rst:5 c8309a887e3e4546835a236a1311bc5f
msgid ""
"MAVProxy can be extended with modules. These run in parallel threads to the "
"main MAVProxy program in order to maintain overall stability."
msgstr "MAVProxy 可通过模块进行扩展。这些模块在独立线程中与 MAVProxy 主程序并行运行，以保持整体稳定性。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/index.rst:8 7e707b1892c94a96816b5ccf8f66c580
msgid ""
"Modules can include such things as GUI elements and diagnostic and "
"monitoring applications."
msgstr "模块可包含 GUI 元素、诊断和监控应用等内容。"

